flow 1

# Onboarding v3: the v2 process with the Fountain approval screens (the UI layer) built in.
# Built from onboarding - v2.vsdx and "Fountain onboarding approval – wireframe" (approval queue, applicant pages).
# Where v2 and the wireframe do not say how steps connect, the link is inferred and marked "Inferred" in a comment.

page "Onboarding v3" size 841x594 direction LR

h_intake: text "1 · Fountain intake" @ 20,16 110x10 [text=#FA4616 size=14]
h_ui: text "2 · Approval UI layer (new in v3)" @ 148,16 180x10 [text=#FA4616 size=14]
